// SENTRY_DSN is supplied by the environment or by `xcodebuild SENTRY_DSN=...`.
// This file must never contain a DSN literal.  An unset value expands empty,
// Info.plist keeps $(SENTRY_DSN), and SentryTelemetry skips init.
// Do not also set SENTRY_DSN in the Xcode project: an explicit empty string
// overrides this xcconfig.
SENTRY_DSN = $(SENTRY_DSN)
